        <mxCell id="router" value="&lt;b&gt;Dense Router&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;q = Softmax(a / τ)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Top-2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;q&lt;sub&gt;top2&lt;/sub&gt; = Top2Normalize(q)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;strokeWidth=1.2;strokeColor=#222222;fillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1">
